#
# The next release key, for a change of the update key. Empty until the
# owner starts one: then the line under these comments is the contents of
# the .pub file `tauri signer generate` wrote for the new key, as is. While
# it is set, maxd trusts releases signed with either key, and the release
# workflow runs the change. The steps are in .github/RELEASING.md.
